:[{"k":"66:1","t":"O Prophet, why do you prohibit [yourself from] what Allāh has made lawful for you, seeking the approval of your wives? And Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"66:2","t":"Allāh has already ordained for you [Muslims] the dissolution of your oaths. And Allāh is your protector, and He is the Knowing, the Wise.","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"66:3","t":"And [remember] when the Prophet confided to one of his wives a statement; and when she informed [another] of it and Allāh showed it to him, he made known part of it and ignored a part. And when he informed her about it, she said, \"Who told you this?\" He said, \"I was informed by the Knowing, the Aware.\"","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"66:4","t":"If you two [wives] repent to Allāh, [it is best], for your hearts have deviated. But if you cooperate against him - then indeed Allāh is his protector, and Gabriel and the righteous of the believers and the angels, moreover, are [his] assistants.","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"66:5","t":"Perhaps his Lord, if he divorced you [all], would substitute for him wives better than you - submitting [to Allāh], believing, devoutly obedient, repentant, worshipping, and traveling - [ones] previously married and virgins.","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"66:6","t":"O you who have believed, protect yourselves and your families from a Fire whose fuel is people and stones, over which are [appointed] angels, harsh and severe; they do not disobey Allāh in what He commands them but do what they are commanded.","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"66:7","t":"O you who have disbelieved, make no excuses that Day. You will only be recompensed for what you used to do.","j":28,"h":56,"s":66,"a":7,"sd":null}],"juz":28,"hizb":56,"surahs":[66],"sajdah":false}